.TH PINENTRY-NOWAYPROMPT 1 2026-07-26 nowayprompt "General Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
pinentry-nowayprompt \- Assuan pinentry service
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pinentry-nowayprompt
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pinentry-nowayprompt
serves the GPG Assuan pinentry protocol. It emits its greeting immediately but
does not initialize a frontend until a GETPIN, CONFIRM, or non-empty MESSAGE
request. OPTION ttyname and OPTION putenv=WAYLAND_DISPLAY issued before the
first prompt configure frontend selection.
.SH FILES
Configuration is shared with
.BR nowayprompt (1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR nowayprompt (1),
.BR nowayprompt.conf (5)
